            "raw_output": "total 24\ndrwxrwsr-x.  3 jovyan users  4096 Sep 16 19:12 .\ndrwxrwsr-x. 14 jovyan users  4096 Sep 17 19:17 ..\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users     0 Sep 14 14:02 __init__.py\ndrwxrwsr-x.  2 jovyan users  4096 Sep 16 19:12 __pycache__\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users 11215 Sep 14 14:02 pl_simple_baseline.py\n=== diff lightning modules ===",
