a=make_data_config(time_delta_input_minutes=[0, -60]),\n        model=ModelConfig(time_embedding=TimeEmbeddingConfig(time_dim=2)),\n    )\n147 tests/test_model_config.py\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/workshop_infrastructure/models",
