True,\n)\nm2 = apply_peft_lora(m2, LoraAdapterConfig())\nm2.train()\no2 = m2(batch)\no2.float().square().mean().backward()\ng = [n for n, p in m2.named_parameters() if p.requires_grad and p.grad is not None]\nprint(f\"ft_checkpoint_head=True: forward+backward ok, {len(g)} trainable tensors got grads\")\nPYEOF"
