    {
      "body": "Real measurement on the T4 \u2014 all three levers move peak memory. But one result contradicts the plan: **`lora_dropout: 0.0` saved only 6 MiB**, not the predicted 1.4\u20132.2 GiB (which would scale to ~90\u2013140 MiB here). Under checkpointing the dropout tensor is transient and doesn't coexist with the true peak. I need to correct the number I wrote into the config comment:",
