            "raw_output": "5:## Overview\n24:## Environment Setup\n33:## Common Commands\n57:## Architecture\n59:### Core Model (`workshop_infrastructure/models/`)\n69:### Downstream Fine-tuning Pattern\n82:### LoRA Fine-tuning\n107:### Data Pipeline\n127:### Configuration\n139:### Distributed Training\n143:## Key File Locations\n=== ADAPTING files ===\ndownstream_apps/sf_triggers/ADAPTING.md\ndownstream_apps/template/ADAPTING.md\nCLAUDE.md\nREADME.md\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/workshop_infrastructure/models"
