      "body": "`ft_checkpoint_head` makes **zero** difference (10.05 both) \u2014 the head's activations don't coexist with the peak, which lives inside a backbone attention recompute. Correctly off by default. Now let me replace the predicted numbers in the docs with the measured ones:",
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::ClaudeAcpPersona"
    },
    {
      "type": "msg",
      "mentions": [],
