      "body": "Training is working \u2014 epoch 0 completed all 8 batches, loss decreasing 0.103 \u2192 0.081, all three helpers fired (36 tuner layers, 86 params + **1 buffer** = `pos_embed`, 36 norms held at fp32), and trainable params are 706,816 exactly as before. Monitoring for completion:",
